en | cache flag |\\n    72|| Notebook | 1792 (VIV demo notebook) | Open | Demo 1 |\\n    73|| Demo 4 | 1873 (shallow water pipelay) | Open | pipelay specs, cache flag |\\n    74|| Screencasts | 1809 (5x .gif recordings) | Open | all 5 demos |\\n    75|\\n    76|### TIER 2 \\u2014 GTM INFRASTRUCTURE\\n    77|Runs parallel with demo building.\\n    78|\\n    79|| Sub-issues | What | Status |\\n    80||-----------|------|--------|\\n    81|| 1707, 1708, 1709 | Scanner fixes (rate limiting, dedup, retention) | Open |\\n    82|| 1971 | Email triage workflow (aceengineer.com) | Open |\\n    83|\\n    84|### TIER 3 \\u2014 OUTREACH\\n    85|Requires demos + infrastructure ready first.\\n    86|\\n    87|| Sub-issues | What | Blocked By |\\n    88||-----------|------|-----------|\\n    89|| 191 | Chatbot fundamentals \\u2014 persona, tone, pitch template | None |\\n    90|| 117 | Oil-and-gas persona + 1-month GTM plan | #191, 2+ demos |\\n    91|| 1669 | Vessel contractor email outreach (20+ targets) | demos, #191, #117 |\\n    92|| 197 | Narada/WhatsApp AI agent replicate guide | None (best after outreach starts) |\\n    93|\\n    94|### TIER 4 \\u2014 PIPELINE MODULES (expand portfolio)\\n    95|\\n    96|| Sub-issues | What | Effort |\\n    97||-----------|------|--------|\\n    98|| 1834 | Field Development Pipeline Engineering skill | 16 hrs |\\n    99|| 1835 | On-bottom stability (DNV-RP-F109) | 12 hrs |\\n   100|| 1836 | Shore approach (HDD, trenching, pull-in) | 10 hrs |\\n   101|| 1837 | Pipeline CAPEX cost model | 8 hrs |\\n   102|\\n   103|### CRITICAL PATH TO FIRST CLIENT\\n   104|\\n   105|```\\n   106|#1994 (register expert networks) -- 2hrs --> $300-600/hr consultations\\n   107|     |\\n   108|     v\\n   109|#1904 (inventory) --> #1798/#1799 (vessel data) --> #1931 (Demo 3) --> #1874 (Demo 5)\\n   110|     |                                                      |\\n   111|#1831/#1832 (cache infra) --> #1930 (Demo 1) --> #1873 (Demo 4) --> #1809 (GIFs)\\n   1