n1. Run `scripts/knowledge/wiki-cross-links.py` (or its current entry point — verify before running) across all 8 wikis: marine-engineering, engineering, naval-architecture, engineering-standards, asset-management, maritime-law, lng-projects, acma-projects\n2. Commit the regenerated `cross-links.md` files\n3. Spot-check that the asset-management `cross-links.md` now exists and shows the inbound references from `risk-based-inspection.md`, `fitness-for-service.md`, `integrity-management-cycle.md` to the engineering wiki\n4. (Optional, scope decision) If vamseeachanta/llm-wiki#22 faceted-portal generation is wired up, run that too — engineering wiki is now at 103 pages and is the largest target\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- 8 `cross-links.md` files refreshed and committed (or note if any wikis don't yet have one as a deliberate gap)\n- Diff reviewable (~bounded by net new pages × link density)\n- No test regressions — `tests/knowledge/test_*` stay green\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- Hand-editing `cross-links.md` files (they're auto-gen)\n- Schema changes to the script\n- Cross-link discovery improvements (#2044, vamseeachanta/workspace-hub#2068 territory)\n- Faceted-portal authoring (separate scope under vamseeachanta/llm-wiki#22)\n\n## References\n\n- vamseeachanta/workspace-hub#2587 (closed) — asset-management close-out flagged the gap\n- vamseeachanta/llm-wiki#36 — cross-link discovery infrastructure\n- vamseeachanta/llm-wiki#35 — engineering wiki cross-link discovery with domain wikis\n- vamseeachanta/llm-wiki#22 — faceted portal pages for large LLM-wiki domains\n- vamseeachanta/llm-wiki#13 — llm-wiki strengthening epic\n","state":"open","user":{"login":"vamseeachanta","name":"vamseeachanta","email":null,"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23155845?v=4","id":23155845},"assignees":null,"labels":[{"name":"priority:low","color":"d4c5f9","description":""},{"name":"cat:documentation","color":"1d76db","description":"Category: documentation / wiki content"},{"name":"domain:knowledge-management","color":"5319e7","description":"Domain: knowledge management / llm-wiki"}],"milestone":null,"state_reason":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-04T03:14:12Z","updated_at":"2026-05-05T22:13:30Z","closed_at":null,"display_url":"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/llm-wiki/issues/21","display_title":"feat(llm-wiki): regenerate cross-links.md across 8 wikis after Tier C page additions"},"url":"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/llm-wiki/issues/21","title":"feat(llm-wiki): regenerate cross-links.md across 8 wikis after Tier C page additions","display_url":"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/llm-wiki/issues/21","display_title":"feat(llm-wiki): regenerate cross-links.md across 8 wikis after Tier C page additions"}},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
