ection: cloud-API secret sourcing, mount-path validation, cache-poisoning protection\\n\\n## Dependencies\\n\\n- **Hard depends on: vamseeachanta/workspace-hub#2403** (model choice must be made first)\\n- Depends on: vamseeachanta/llm-wiki#23 (`doc_key` in wiki frontmatter), vamseeachanta/workspace-hub#2361, vamseeachanta/workspace-hub#2362\\n- Blocks: vamseeachanta/workspace-hub#2394 (retrieval-augmented planner), vamseeachanta/workspace-hub#2400 (MCP wiki_search tool)\\n\\n## Scope boundaries\\n\\n- **In scope:** build, query, manifest, cost-cap, cron, secrets, threat model.\\n- **Out of scope:** downstream consumers (planner, MCP server) \\u2014 live in their own issues.\", \"state\": null, \"user\": null, \"assignees\": null, \"labels\": null, \"milestone\": null, \"state_reason\": null, \"comments\": null, \"created_at\": null, \"updated_at\": null, \"closed_at\": null, \"display_url\": \"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/workspace-hub/issues/2402\", \"display_title\": \"feat(doc-intel): build embeddings index L2+L3 + query CLI (single authoritative tier)\"}, {\"url\": \"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/workspace-hub/issues/2152\", \"title\": \"test(reporting): add golden fixture corpus for weekly review run artifacts and validator coverage\", \"issue_number\": 2152, \"body\": \"## Summary\\nAdd the golden fixture corpus for weekly review run artifacts and validator coverage.\\n\\n## Why\\nValidator and renderer work need stable example artifacts representing healthy, degraded, and invalid runs. Fixtures also flush out schema ambiguities early.\\n\\n## Scope\\n- add valid weekly-review run artifact fixtures for minimal, full, degraded, and multi-machine runs\\n- add invalid fixtures for missing keys, bad enums, bad timestamps, and malformed sections\\n- define expected validator outcomes for invalid cases\\n- document fixture naming and refresh rules\\n- wire fixtures into validator CI tests\\n\\n## Deliverables\\n- valid and invalid fixture corpus\\n- expected 